化イベントを蓄積し、効果を検証してから判断します）。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,93.1 14.2,90.7 19.3,87.7 24.5,84.4 29.6,81.9 34.7,85.0 39.8,79.4 44.9,75.1 50.0,75.4 55.1,78.2 60.3,74.1 65.4,69.7 70.5,69.0 75.6,64.1 80.7,58.0 85.8,56.2 91.0,56.5 96.1,52.6 101.2,40.5 106.3,28.3 111.4,36.2 116.5,37.0 121.6,38.4 126.8,47.9 131.9,46.6 137.0,48.2 142.1,48.1 147.2,42.6 152.3,42.9 157.4,38.5 162.6,38.0 167.7,49.1 172.8,45.8 177.9,43.5 183.0,42.3 188.1,36.8 193.2,43.6 198.4,46.1 203.5,45.1 208.6,38.5 213.7,38.2 218.8,40.3 223.9,39.5 229.0,33.7 234.2,33.0 239.3,32.8 244.4,29.6 249.5,35.3 254.6,35.6 259.7,30.5 264.9,16.9 270.0,22.7 275.1,19.6 280.2,13.6 285.3,17.8 290.4,12.8 295.5,13.0 300.7,13.2 305.8,13.8 310.9,21.3 316.0,23.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"23.7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,90.8 6.1,91.8 8.3,92.0 10.4,88.3 12.5,90.7 14.7,93.1 16.8,93.0 19.0,93.8 21.1,93.8 23.2,94.3 25.4,95.1 27.5,94.0 29.6,93.8 31.8,93.8 33.9,92.0 36.1,91.9 38.2,92.6 4